        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t index="1" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:02,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:09,225</end-time>
                <translation>被誉为战后最难懂名著的吉本隆明的《共同幻想论》
戦後最も難解な名著と言われる吉本隆明の共同幻想論</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="2" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:09,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:11,978</end-time>
                <translation>吉本通过解读《古事记》
吉本は古事記を紐解き</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="3" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:11,978</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:14,675</end-time>
                <translation>试图探究国家是如何从中诞生的</translation>
                <original>そこから国家がどう生まれたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="4" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:14,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:18,650</end-time>
                <translation>以及其背后的机制</translation>
                <original>そのメカニズムを探ろうとしました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="5" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:18,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:20,575</end-time>
                <translation>他发现国家的形成</translation>
                <original>そして国家の成り立ちには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="6" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:20,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:23,423</end-time>
                <translation>与民族所持有的罪意识
民族が持つ罪の意識が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="7" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:23,423</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:26,915</end-time>
                <translation>有着深刻的关联</translation>
                <original>大きく関わることに気づくのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="8" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:28,405</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:35,060</end-time>
                <translation>第3回将解读吉本试图阐明的国家形成的故事</translation>
                <original>第3回は吉本が解き明かそうとした国家形成の物語を読み解いていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="9" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:53,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:59,500</end-time>
                <translation>第3回 国家形成的故事
第3回　国家形成の物語</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="10" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:00,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:02,700</end-time>
                <translation>《100分de名著》主持人安部美智子
100分de名著司会の安部みちこです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="11" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:02,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:04,075</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="12" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:04,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:07,267</end-time>
                <translation>上一回我们谈到爱欲和死亡</translation>
                <original>前回はエロスですとか死というものが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="13" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:07,267</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:10,770</end-time>
                <translation>与国家的起源有着深刻的关联</translation>
                <original>国家の始まりには深い関わりがあるんだ というお話でしたけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="14" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:10,770</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:12,750</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 到此位置怎么样</translation>
                <original>伊集院さんここまでいかがですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="15" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:12,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:15,842</end-time>
                <translation>这本书确实非常难</translation>
                <original>この本も非常に難しい本だな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="16" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:15,842</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:18,275</end-time>
                <translation>我抱着啃硬骨头的心态在读</translation>
                <original>手強いなと思って取り組んではいるんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="17" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:18,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:20,400</end-time>
                <translation>果然在战争结束时</translation>
                <original>やっぱり戦争が終わった時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="18" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:20,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:25,225</end-time>
                <translation>即使被告知自己曾经热爱的国家</translation>
                <original>今までそれこそすごい好きだった国って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="19" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:25,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:27,325</end-time>
                <translation>其实并非如此</translation>
                <original>違ってましたって言われても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="20" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:27,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:29,200</end-time>
                <translation>如果不整理清楚</translation>
                <original>それを整理しないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="21" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:29,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:31,224</end-time>
                <translation>就无法继续前进</translation>
                <original>何も進めないと思った</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="22" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:31,224</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,000</end-time>
                <translation>这个出发点对我来说非常重要</translation>
                <original>っていうそのスタートが僕の中ですごく大事で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="23" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:34,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,600</end-time>
                <translation>我每回都会都抱着这个出发点去思考的</translation>
                <original>そこそこがスタートと思いながら毎回取り組んでおります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="24" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:38,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:40,260</end-time>
                <translation>那么让我们来介绍老师</translation>
                <original>では先生ご紹介しましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="25" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:40,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:42,275</end-time>
                <translation>研究日本思想史的</translation>
                <original>日本思想史をご研究されています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="26" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:42,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,925</end-time>
                <translation>先崎彰容老师
先崎彰容さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="27" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:43,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:46,550</end-time>
                <translation>请多关照</translation>
                <original>よろしくお願いします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="28" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:46,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:49,225</end-time>
                <translation>今天我们要读的是这部分</translation>
                <original>今日読んでいくのはこちらになります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="29" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:49,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:52,220</end-time>
                <translation>第4章的罪责论</translation>
                <original>4章の罪責論主に見ていきますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="30" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:52,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:54,760</end-time>
                <translation>是的 正如标题所示</translation>
                <original>そうですねタイトルにもあります通り</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="31" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:54,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,925</end-time>
                <translation>这是关于罪与伦理的考察</translation>
                <original>罪そして倫理についての考察なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="32" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:01:58,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:02,775</end-time>
                <translation>吉本认为要思考国家的诞生</translation>
                <original>吉本はですね国家が誕生するにはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="33" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:02,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:08,600</end-time>
                <translation>必须思考我们自身所持有的罪意识</translation>
                <original>我々自身が持っている罪の意識というのを考えるべきだというふうに言いました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="34" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:08,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,864</end-time>
                <translation>具体到神话中来说</translation>
                <original>で具体的に神話で言いますと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="35" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:10,864</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:13,525</end-time>
                <translation>他将农耕之神须佐之男</translation>
                <original>農耕の神であるスサノオがですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="36" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:13,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:19,175</end-time>
                <translation>视为日本最早犯下罪行的人物</translation>
                <original>日本で最初に罪を犯した人物として登場するということになりますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="37" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:19,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,325</end-time>
                <translation>那么首先 罪意识是如何产生的？</translation>
                <original>ではまずは罪の意識がどのように生まれたのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="38" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:22,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:25,640</end-time>
                <translation>请从《古事记》中须佐之男与天照的神话看起</translation>
                <original>古事記のスサノオとアマテラスの神話からご覧いただきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="39" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:27,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:31,675</end-time>
                <translation>被父神伊邪那岐命令统治海原</translation>
                <original>父イザナギから海原の統治を命じられ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="40" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:31,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:35,780</end-time>
                <translation>因拒绝这一命令而被放逐的须佐之男</translation>
                <original>その命を拒絶した結果追放されてしまったスサノオ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="41" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:37,605</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:44,450</end-time>
                <translation>之后须佐之男在姐姐天照统治的高天原为所欲为</translation>
                <original>その後スサノオは姉アマテラスの統治する高間ヶ原でやりたい放題</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="42" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:44,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:48,450</end-time>
                <translation>毁坏田地 在神圣的神殿里大便等</translation>
                <original>田を荒らし神聖な神殿に大便をするなど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="43" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:48,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:52,450</end-time>
                <translation>做出了无法无天的粗暴行径</translation>
                <original>手のつけられぬ乱暴ろうぜきぶりでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="44" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:52,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:55,875</end-time>
                <translation>有一次 他扔出剥下的马皮</translation>
                <original>ある時剥いた馬の皮を投げて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="45" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:02:55,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:58,475</end-time>
                <translation>害死了织女</translation>
                <original>機織り女を死なせてしまいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="46" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:01,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:06,225</end-time>
                <translation>目睹了这一幕的天照 在打开天岩屋的门走进去后</translation>
                <original>それを見たアマテラスはアマの岩屋の戸を開いて中に入ると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="47" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:06,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:10,700</end-time>
                <translation>将自己关了进去</translation>
                <original>閉じこもってしまうのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="48" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:10,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:14,050</end-time>
                <translation>火神天照躲进了岩屋</translation>
                <original>火の神であるアマテラスが岩屋にこもると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="49" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:14,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:18,600</end-time>
                <translation>高天原和地上世界都被黑暗笼罩
高間ヶ原も地上界も暗闇に包まれ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="50" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:18,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:21,540</end-time>
                <translation>许多灾祸开始发生</translation>
                <original>多くの災いが起こり始めます</original>
