            <t index="51" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:23,115</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:25,738</end-time>
                <translation>束手无策的八百万众神
困り果てた八百万の神々は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="52" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:25,738</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:28,942</end-time>
                <translation>想出了一个计策</translation>
                <original>策を練りました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="53" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:30,742</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:33,650</end-time>
                <translation>“因为有比你更尊贵的神降临了</translation>
                <original>あなた様より尊い神様がいらっしゃったので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="54" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:33,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:36,450</end-time>
                <translation>大家都在欢欣鼓舞”</translation>
                <original>みんな喜んでいるのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="55" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:36,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:41,600</end-time>
                <translation>这样将她引出来后 天照打开岩屋的门走了出来</translation>
                <original>と誘い出すとアマテラスは岩屋の戸を開いて出てきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="56" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:44,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:49,450</end-time>
                <translation>就这样 天地间重新恢复了秩序</translation>
                <original>こうして天と地に再び秩序が取り戻されたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="57" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:51,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:55,925</end-time>
                <translation>须佐之男被八百万神拔掉胡须</translation>
                <original>八百万の神によりスサノオは髭を抜かれ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="58" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:03:55,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:01,125</end-time>
                <translation>剥去指甲 没收财产</translation>
                <original>爪を剥がされ財産を没収されます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="59" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:04:01,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:05,775</end-time>
                <translation>然后背负原罪 被驱逐到根之国</translation>
                <original>そして原罪を背負って根の国へ追いやられたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="60" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:04:11,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:18,400</end-time>
                <translation>可以认为，这一〈原罪〉确实发源于农耕土民的村落社会〈共同幻想〉</translation>
                <original>この原罪が農耕土民の集落的な社会の共同幻想と</original>
                <spell/>
