                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="71" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:05:12,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:17,900</end-time>
                <translation>从中萌生的原罪 不久被原始农耕民继承了下来</translation>
                <original>ここに芽生えた原罪はやがて原始農耕民に受け継がれました</original>
