            <t index="87" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:27,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:29,125</end-time>
                <translation>让我们来看看吧</translation>
                <original>を見てみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="88" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:29,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:31,720</end-time>
                <translation>首先 须佐之男在哪里呢？</translation>
                <original>まずスサノオはですねどこにいるかというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="89" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:31,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:33,675</end-time>
                <translation>他本来是以中间的这个</translation>
                <original>本来は真ん中のですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="90" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:33,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:37,950</end-time>
                <translation>原始农耕社会的规则、秩序和价值观
