            <t index="96" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:52,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:54,550</end-time>
                <translation>最基础的社会</translation>
                <original>最も基本的な社会</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="97" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:06:54,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:59,300</end-time>
                <translation>这其中也有其独特的价值观和秩序</translation>
                <original>でここにも独自の価値観や秩序があるわけですね</original>
