            </t>
            <t index="104" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:18,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:22,900</end-time>
                <translation>出现了与罪恶感相关的内容</translation>
                <original>ここに罪の意識という話につながる部分が出てくるわけですね</original>
