            </t>
            <t index="105" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:22,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:26,325</end-time>
                <translation>等等 那就是我须佐本来也是原始农耕的人</translation>
                <original>ちょっと待ってて俺も元々原始農耕の人だから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="106" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:26,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:29,250</end-time>
                <translation>让我治理海洋什么的 根本做不到啊</translation>
