            </t>
            <t index="109" torder="1" id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:07:31,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:35,100</end-time>
                <translation>但这里的逻辑突然就跳了</translation>
                <original>でもいきなりドーンって違和感ではなくて</original>
